{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20302","headline":"促促词 · 张籍","name":"促促词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促促复促促，家贫夫妇欢不足。\n今年爲人送租船，去年捕鱼在江边。\n家中姑老子复小，自执吴绡输税钱。\n家家桑麻满地黑，念君一身空努力。\n愿教牛蹄团团羊角直，君身常在应不得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}